 "applies_to": "Produal TRC-P touchscreen room controllers (fan coil, chilled beam, radiator and auxiliary heat applications), BAC models.",
 "summary": "TRC-P is a wall-mounted touchscreen room controller with temperature, optional humidity and CO2, and analog, relay or triac outputs depending on the variant. BAC models talk BACnet MS/TP (B-ASC) on the RS-485 terminals. The user guide lists 43 standard objects: measurements and control demands, setpoints and dead zones, output limits and values, mode/status flags and fan speed.",
