 "notes": [
  "Object names, value ranges and units are from the user guide, chapter 5 (software 5.01 or newer); the guide has no read/write column, so access is inferred from what each object does.",
  "Configuration parameters sit in proprietary objects (Config1 etc., type proprietary-128) and are not listed here.",
  "The Alarm MSV carries a 5-bit alarm word plus 1 (internal sensor, RI1, RI2, humidity sensor, DI1).",
  "MS/TP 9600 (default), 19200, 38400, 56000 or 76800 bit/s, 1 stop bit, 1/2 unit load.",
  "Which inputs and outputs exist depends on the TRC-P variant; Y1-Y3 and DO1-DO2 follow the BMS only when the output is set to Network."
